---
import { importServices, exportServices, stats, serviceImages } from '../../data/content';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---
<section id="servicios" class="py-14 md:py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
<p class="kick text-amber-700">Servicios</p><h2 class="h mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink">Una operación, dos sentidos</h2>
<p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">Soluciones integrales para el comercio internacional y la industria.</p>
<div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6">
<article id="importacion" class="box p-0! overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
<div class="relative aspect-[2/1] overflow-hidden bg-[linear-gradient(130deg,#0B2D4A,#123C63)]"><div class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center text-slate-500"><Icon name="ship" class="w-14 h-14"/></div><img src={serviceImages.import.image} alt={serviceImages.import.alt} loading="lazy" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.remove()"/></div>
<div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1"><p class="kick text-amber-700">China → México</p><h3 class="h text-2xl mt-1 text-ink">Importación</h3>
<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-600">{importServices.map(s => <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-ink shrink-0 mt-0.5"><Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4"/></span>{s}</li>)}</ul>
<a href="#cotizar" class="mt-auto pt-5 font-semibold text-ink hover:text-brand-dark text-sm">Conocer más →</a></div></article>
<article id="exportacion" class="box p-0! overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
<div class="relative aspect-[2/1] overflow-hidden bg-[linear-gradient(130deg,#0B2D4A,#123C63)]"><div class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center text-slate-500"><Icon name="plane" class="w-14 h-14"/></div><img src={serviceImages.export.image} alt={serviceImages.export.alt} loading="lazy" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.remove()"/></div>
<div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1"><p class="kick text-amber-700">México → China</p><h3 class="h text-2xl mt-1 text-ink">Exportación</h3>
<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-600">{exportServices.map(s => <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-ink shrink-0 mt-0.5"><Icon name="check" class="w-4 h-4"/></span>{s}</li>)}</ul>
<a href="#cotizar" class="mt-auto pt-5 font-semibold text-ink hover:text-brand-dark text-sm">Conocer más →</a></div></article>
<article class="box p-0! overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
<div class="relative aspect-[2/1] overflow-hidden bg-[linear-gradient(130deg,#0B2D4A,#123C63)]"><div class="absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center text-slate-500"><Icon name="gear" class="w-14 h-14"/></div><img src={serviceImages.machinery.image} alt={serviceImages.machinery.alt} loading="lazy" class="relative w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.remove()"/></div>
<div class="p-5 flex flex-col flex-1"><p class="kick text-amber-700">Industrial</p><h3 class="h text-2xl mt-1 text-ink">Maquinaria Industrial</h3>
<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-600">Inyectoras, cortadoras láser CNC, líneas de envasado y más. Adaptadas al voltaje y normativa mexicana (220V/440V · 60Hz · NOM).</p>
<a href="#maquinaria" class="mt-auto pt-5 font-semibold text-ink hover:text-brand-dark text-sm">Conocer más →</a></div></article>
</div>
<div class="mt-10 md:mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-line rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-line">
{stats.map(s => <div class="bg-mist px-6 py-6 flex items-center gap-4"><span class="mono text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-ink">{s.value}</span><span class="text-sm text-slate-600">{s.label}</span></div>)}
</div></div></section>
